<section class="section about-origin" aria-labelledby="about-origin-title"><div class="section-shell about-origin-layout"><div class="about-origin-photo"><img src="<?php echo $baseUrl; ?>/assets/images/our-story-img.webp" alt="Whole house water filter specialists" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="about-origin-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Our story</p><h2 id="about-origin-title">Whole house water filter specialists</h2><p>PureLine started with a question we kept hearing from homeowners: why is good water still so complicated? People were juggling filter jugs, under-sink cartridges and slabs of bottled water, and still showering in chlorinated water every morning.</p>
<p>So we set out to build one system that treats the whole house, meets Australian plumbing standards and is easy to look after.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section about-operations" aria-labelledby="about-operations-title"><div class="section-shell"><div class="about-operations-panel"><div class="about-operations-heading"><span class="about-purpose-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5 9-5Zm-9 9 9 5 9-5M3 16l9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><h2 id="about-operations-title">How PureLine Water Filtration System is set up</h2></div><div class="about-operations-copy"><p>Our filtration systems are made with experienced OEM manufacturing partners and certified to Australian standards before they reach a customer. Installation is carried out by licensed plumbers. Ongoing servicing is handled by our own team and our dealer network.</p>
<p>That model lets us keep quality consistent without pretending we make every part ourselves. What we control is the product specification, the installation standard and the aftercare.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-shell"><div class="section-heading section-heading--center"><h2 id="about-values-title">What we stand for</h2></div><div class="about-values"><article class="about-value"><span class="about-value-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 5a5 5 0 0 0-8 1 5 5 0 0 0-8-1c-5 5 8 15 8 15S25 10 20 5Z"/><path d="M6 12h3l2-4 2 7 2-3h3"/></svg></span><h3>Health first</h3><p>We reduce the things you don't want in your water while leaving natural minerals like calcium and magnesium in place.</p></article><article class="about-value"><span class="about-value-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5 9-5Zm-9 9 9 5 9-5M3 16l9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><h3>Proper engineering</h3><p>Multi-stage filtration, food-grade housings and stainless steel brackets. Every system is certified and built to last in Australian conditions.</p></article><article class="about-value"><span class="about-value-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2S5 10 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 14 0c0-5-7-13-7-13Z"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Keep it simple</h3><p>One system, one installation, filtered water everywhere. No jugs to refill and no separate shower filters to replace.</p></article><article class="about-value"><span class="about-value-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 3C8 2 2 8 5 16c8 6 17-2 15-13ZM4 21l11-12"/></svg></span><h3>Less waste</h3><p>Filtered tap water means fewer plastic bottles. Long-life cartridges mean fewer replacements going to landfill.</p></article><article class="about-value"><span class="about-value-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14v-3a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v3M4 12H2v6h4v-6Zm16 0h2v6h-4v-6Zm0 6c0 3-4 3-8 3"/></svg></span><h3>Service that stays</h3><p>We don't disappear once the plumber leaves. We track your cartridge dates, remind you when they're due and help if anything changes.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section about-tint"><div class="section-shell"><div class="section-heading section-heading--center about-cert-heading"><h2 id="about-standards-title">The standards behind every install</h2></div><div class="about-standards"><div class="about-cert-intro"><p>Water filters connect to your drinking water supply, so they're regulated like any other plumbing product. Here's what each certification on our system actually means.</p></div><div class="about-cert-grid"><article class="about-cert-card"><span class="about-cert-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6Z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>WaterMark</h3><p>the Australian certification scheme for plumbing and drainage products, administered by the Australian Building Codes Board. Products installed on a plumbing system generally need it.</p></article><article class="about-cert-card"><span class="about-cert-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2S5 10 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 14 0c0-5-7-13-7-13Z"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>AS/NZS 4020:2018</h3><p>tests products that touch drinking water for taste, appearance, microbial growth, cytotoxicity, mutagenicity and the leaching of metals and organic compounds. Our system passed every category.</p></article><article class="about-cert-card"><span class="about-cert-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 5a6 6 0 0 0-7 7l-4 4a3 3 0 0 0 4 4l4-4a6 6 0 0 0 8-7l-4 4-4-4 4-4Z"/></svg></span><h3>AS/NZS 3500</h3><p>the plumbing and drainage standard our licensed plumbers install to, alongside the Plumbing Code of Australia.</p></article></div><div class="about-cert-links"><p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo $baseUrl; ?>/whole-house-water-filter.php">Triple-Stage Whole House Water Filter &#8594;</a></p><p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.abcb.gov.au/product-certification/watermark" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ABCB WaterMark certification &#8594;</a></p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section how-we-work"><div class="section-shell hw-layout"><div class="hw-main"><h2>How we work with homeowners</h2><ol class="hw-steps">
<li class="hw-step"><span class="hw-step__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4Z"/><path d="M8 10h8M8 13h5"/></svg></span><div class="hw-step__body"><span class="hw-step__label">We listen first</span><p>Most people who call us have one specific annoyance. Maybe the water smells like a pool, the shower screen is always crusted, or they're tired of carrying bottled water home. We start there, not with a sales pitch.</p></div></li>
<li class="hw-step"><span class="hw-step__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6"/><path d="m20 20-4.5-4.5M8.5 11h5M11 8.5v5"/></svg></span><div class="hw-step__body"><span class="hw-step__label">We assess, then recommend</span><p>At the assessment we look at where your water comes in, how your plumbing is laid out and what you're trying to fix. Then we recommend the smallest setup that actually solves it. Sometimes that's our full triple-stage system. Sometimes it's a pre-filter added for a tank supply. Occasionally it's telling you a simple under-sink filter will do.</p></div></li>
<li class="hw-step"><span class="hw-step__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6Z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 14l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><div class="hw-step__body"><span class="hw-step__label">You decide in your own time</span><p>You get the recommendation and the price in writing, and you decide in your own time. We don't do same-day pressure or &quot;sign tonight&quot; discounts.</p></div></li>
</ol></div><aside class="hw-panel"><h2>What you can expect from us</h2><ul class="hw-promises">
<li class="hw-promise"><span class="hw-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 12.5 4 4 8-9"/></svg></span><span>A licensed plumber on every installation, never an unlicensed installer</span></li>
<li class="hw-promise"><span class="hw-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 12.5 4 4 8-9"/></svg></span><span>A fixed written quote before any work starts</span></li>
<li class="hw-promise"><span class="hw-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 12.5 4 4 8-9"/></svg></span><span>Clear information about what the system will and won't remove</span></li>
<li class="hw-promise"><span class="hw-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 12.5 4 4 8-9"/></svg></span><span>Reminders when your cartridges are due, so the system keeps doing its job</span></li>
<li class="hw-promise"><span class="hw-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 12.5 4 4 8-9"/></svg></span><span>Someone to call if anything changes, like a renovation or a move to tank water</span></li>
</ul></aside></div></section>
<section class="section about-purpose"><div class="section-shell about-purpose-grid"><article class="about-purpose-card"><span class="about-purpose-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s4-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-4 7-10 7S2 12 2 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><h2>Our vision</h2><p>We want whole house water filtration to be a normal part of an Australian home, the same way a hot water system is. Not a luxury, just a sensible thing to have.</p></article><article class="about-purpose-card about-purpose-card--promise"><span class="about-purpose-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6Z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h2>Our promise</h2><p>From the first visit to the day you turn on the tap, the goal doesn't change: filtered water you can trust, a price agreed up front and no surprise bills afterwards.</p></article></div></section>
